# Check out text files with LF on every platform (overrides a system core.autocrlf=true).
# DVC 3 hashes dependency files byte-for-byte, so code/config/report dependencies must have
# identical bytes in every clone for `dvc status` to match dvc.lock (DOC-03 MAC-03).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.joblib binary
*.db binary
